# Place your WireGuard config here as wg0.conf (and any wg*.conf).
# Bind-mounted to /etc/wireguard in the container.
# The entrypoint runs `wg-quick up wg0` when /etc/wireguard/wg0.conf exists.
#
# Requires the container to run with NET_ADMIN capability and /dev/net/tun,
# which are configured in docker-compose.yml.
#
# If your config uses `DNS = ...`, wg-quick edits /etc/resolv.conf directly
# (the image deliberately ships no `resolvconf`, since the Debian package needs
# systemd-resolved, which isn't available in a container). If DNS resolution
# still fails, point DNS at a public resolver.
